    {
      "id": "8LN82p0zLpJGTJzDTRoxa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1388.0656774493814,
      "y": 483.28478128402276,
      "width": 358.7198791503906,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "irN6CKj1gHKVAAgPUNGry",
      "index": "b92z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2056982142,
      "version": 746,
      "versionNonce": 978383201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786356583528,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "라우팅 ENI (NATGW, GWLB, ...) : \nSG X\n소스/대상 확인 X -> 즉시 데이터 처리\n\n컴퓨팅 ENI : \nSG O\n소스/대상 확인 O -> 데이터 처리 후 전달",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "라우팅 ENI (NATGW, GWLB, ...) : \nSG X\n소스/대상 확인 X -> 즉시 데이터 처리\n\n컴퓨팅 ENI : \nSG O\n소스/대상 확인 O -> 데이터 처리 후 전달",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "irN6CKj1gHKVAAgPUNGry",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1335.2680584017621,
      "y": 139.83241337015806,
      "width": 1683.125,
      "height": 557.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#bbb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b93",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1499687361,
      "version": 199,
      "versionNonce": 1960464769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786356583097,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "name": "ENI"
    },
    {
      "id": "TYCHZ9qIyxKh2eCd5FYNe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1383.452582211286,
      "y": 2883.9296375585045,
      "width": 712.819580078125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VbknOaiY5u74sdfZmnl7K",
      "index": "b938",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2012275536,
      "version": 1872,
      "versionNonce": 1950394529,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786356672017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TGW = Transit Gateway (VPC / On-prem)\n- 중앙 네트워크 라우터 (Regional)\n- Attachment (VPC,VPN,PCX,DXGW) = 참여 후보\n- Attachment ENI(s)\n  1AZ 1Subnet 1ENI\n\n1 TGW N TGW 라우팅 테이블\n\n- Attachment를 TGW 라우팅 테이블에 Association = 참여\n  Attachment는 특정 TGW에 대해서 1 TGW 라우팅 테이블만 Association 가능\n  동일 TGW 라우팅 테이블에 Association된 Attachment끼리만 통신 가능\n  CIDR 라우팅 등록(수동, static) 또는 전파(자동, propagated)해야 통신 가능\n\n- 동일/교차 리전 통신을 위해서는 각 리전 TGW 피어링\n\nTGW를 RAM (Resource Access Manager)로 동일 리전 내 공유 가능",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TGW = Transit Gateway (VPC / On-prem)\n- 중앙 네트워크 라우터 (Regional)\n- Attachment (VPC,VPN,PCX,DXGW) = 참여 후보\n- Attachment ENI(s)\n  1AZ 1Subnet 1ENI\n\n1 TGW N TGW 라우팅 테이블\n\n- Attachment를 TGW 라우팅 테이블에 Association = 참여\n  Attachment는 특정 TGW에 대해서 1 TGW 라우팅 테이블만 Association 가능\n  동일 TGW 라우팅 테이블에 Association된 Attachment끼리만 통신 가능\n  CIDR 라우팅 등록(수동, static) 또는 전파(자동, propagated)해야 통신 가능\n\n- 동일/교차 리전 통신을 위해서는 각 리전 TGW 피어링\n\nTGW를 RAM (Resource Access Manager)로 동일 리전 내 공유 가능",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bL30OvBymNcVz3sepva38",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2045.9525822112864,
      "y": 2897.5407476348137,
      "width": 485.77972412109375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VbknOaiY5u74sdfZmnl7K",
      "index": "b93G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 482038096,
      "version": 953,
      "versionNonce": 1811181039,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786356672017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PCX = VPC Peering Connection (VPC)\n- CIDR이 중첩되면 피어링 불가\n- 전이적 피어링 불가 (VPC - PCX - VPC - PCX -VPC)\n- N VPC : N(N-1)/2 PCX(s) Full-mesh\n- 라우팅 테이블 PCX 경로 필요",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PCX = VPC Peering Connection (VPC)\n- CIDR이 중첩되면 피어링 불가\n- 전이적 피어링 불가 (VPC - PCX - VPC - PCX -VPC)\n- N VPC : N(N-1)/2 PCX(s) Full-mesh\n- 라우팅 테이블 PCX 경로 필요",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s5lr_XjUmb7ISd3vFgr7o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2197.6192488779534,
      "y": 3115.0407507392224,
      "width": 312.97979736328125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VbknOaiY5u74sdfZmnl7K",
      "index": "b93O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 511607632,
      "version": 505,
      "versionNonce": 1313139841,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786356672017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VPC - PCX - VPC\nVPC - VGW - VPN/DX - On-prem\nVPC - TGW - VPC\nVPC - TGW - VPN/DX - On-prem",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VPC - PCX - VPC\nVPC - VGW - VPN/DX - On-prem\nVPC - TGW - VPC\nVPC - TGW - VPN/DX - On-prem",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Mp1_BHEV08Y1uF6C97BZM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3332.440677449382,
      "y": 2937.104241767911,
      "width": 487.6197814941406,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VbknOaiY5u74sdfZmnl7K",
      "index": "b93V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 993268048,
      "version": 1062,
      "versionNonce": 1445910543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786356672017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VPN Connection (AWS 외부, 인터넷 기반, 터널 암호화)\n- Site-to-Site = IPsec 터널링\n- CGW = Customer Gateway Device\n- VPC - VGW - VPN - CGW(StaticIP) - On-prem\n- VPC 라우팅 테이블 VGW On-prem CIDR 경로",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VPN Connection (AWS 외부, 인터넷 기반, 터널 암호화)\n- Site-to-Site = IPsec 터널링\n- CGW = Customer Gateway Device\n- VPC - VGW - VPN - CGW(StaticIP) - On-prem\n- VPC 라우팅 테이블 VGW On-prem CIDR 경로",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZC41HDQRiQWr-cxuk4gm-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2132.3064393425184,
      "y": 3271.826465024937,
      "width": 404.8797302246094,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VbknOaiY5u74sdfZmnl7K",
      "index": "b93d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1432443216,
      "version": 990,
      "versionNonce": 181777505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786356672017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VGW = Virtual Private Gateway (On-prem)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VGW = Virtual Private Gateway (On-prem)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4oTvOWjXE-qE2mMbgJ-V_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2617.6192488779534,
      "y": 2896.6478935963637,
      "width": 769.01953125,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "VbknOaiY5u74sdfZmnl7K",
      "index": "b93l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 521952176,
      "version": 1864,
      "versionNonce": 2111241775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786356672017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DX = Direct Connect\n- 전용선 Leased Line\n- DX Location (AWS Data Center) (가산/평촌)\n  - AWS Cage (AWS DX Router)\n  - Customer / Partner cage (Customer / Partner Router)\n- 1 물리적 DX 연결을 N 가상 DX 연결로 분리 (VIF)\n- VIF = Virtual Interface\n  - On-prem - Public VIF (EIP) - S3, ...\n  - On-prem - Private VIF - VGW - VPC (Regional)\n  - On-prem - Private VIF - DXGW - VGW - VPC(s) (Global)\n  - On-prem - Transit VIF - DXGW - TGW - VPC(s) (Global)\n    TGW 덕분에 교차 VPC 통신 가능\n- 1 DXGW에 VGW와 TGW를 동시 연결 불가능 (둘 중 하나만)\n\nVPN + DX\nVPC <- (IPsec) -> VPN - AWS Dx router <- (BGP Session) -> Customer Router\nDX로 지연 DOWN, VPN 암호화로 신뢰성 UP",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DX = Direct Connect\n- 전용선 Leased Line\n- DX Location (AWS Data Center) (가산/평촌)\n  - AWS Cage (AWS DX Router)\n  - Customer / Partner cage (Customer / Partner Router)\n- 1 물리적 DX 연결을 N 가상 DX 연결로 분리 (VIF)\n- VIF = Virtual Interface\n  - On-prem - Public VIF (EIP) - S3, ...\n  - On-prem - Private VIF - VGW - VPC (Regional)\n  - On-prem - Private VIF - DXGW - VGW - VPC(s) (Global)\n  - On-prem - Transit VIF - DXGW - TGW - VPC(s) (Global)\n    TGW 덕분에 교차 VPC 통신 가능\n- 1 DXGW에 VGW와 TGW를 동시 연결 불가능 (둘 중 하나만)\n\nVPN + DX\nVPC <- (IPsec) -> VPN - AWS Dx router <- (BGP Session) -> Customer Router\nDX로 지연 DOWN, VPN 암호화로 신뢰성 UP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
